      </li>
      <li>
      <p><a href="http://proceedings.spiedigitallibrary.org/proceeding.aspx?articleid=1346716">Introducing high performance distributed logging service for ACS</a>
      J. Avarias, J. López, <strong>C. Maureira</strong>, H. Sommer, G. Chiozzi
